  "label": "racist_meme_scene",
  "description": "The intended audience for this meme is individuals who are familiar with and receptive to racially charged stereotypes, particularly those that target Barack Obama based on his Kenyan heritage. The meme relies on the audience's understanding of the 'kenyan skidmark' stereotype and the political context of the Mueller Report to convey its hateful message. This audience likely includes those who hold or are exposed to anti-Black racist tropes and who may be politically motivated to question or attack Obama's integrity based on his race and perceived silence on the Mueller Report. The meme is designed to resonate with communities that use or propagate such racist and politically charged content, often found in far-right or alt-right online spaces.",
